        "title": "FortBite™ – Daily Nutritional Support for Everyday Wellness",
        "meta_descr": "FortBite™ is a daily dietary supplement designed to complement your wellness routine with convenient nutritional support. Its formula is intended to support everyday vitality, nutritional balance, and normal body functions while fitting easily into a healthy lifestyle.",
        "header_custom": "<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"prosta defend, prostadefend, prosta defend supplement, prosta defend pills\">\n <meta name=\"author\" content=\"prosta defend\">\n\t\t\n <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"\" >",
